{"id": "1531039222331478096", "channel_id": "1531036924922564858", "author_id": "706262934485073951", "author_name": "bagels5899", "content": "the three “high aliemus with aliemus on AA” units so far can battery themselves okayish\n\nSaya definetly the best one but in exchange perception warp can help or hinder you\n\nPontos eats all the arithmetica for aliemus with X cost (and if you’re fighting an enemy with counter you basically don’t have an X cost)\n\nGLotan hasn’t dropped yet but we know her main method is stealing it from others which is fun\n\nand all 3 AAs give them a good source/buff the aliemus they get while somewhat requiring you to interact less with that downside\n\na toggle would also be a step in the right direction", "timestamp": "2026-07-26T20:43:15.937000+00:00", "thread_id": "1531036924922564858"}
